    # v0.9.0 requirements baseline
    
    ## Evidence sources
    
    | Source | Identity | Supported use |
    |---|---|---|
    | v0.8.2 source artifact | artifact 1119, SHA-256 `46bd49e0310ff39b9da906ae024e834ba47ddacc2ae0700b62fd7603b9328c9d` | Exact v0.8.2 source baseline |
